    "text": "In diebus illis dixit Isaias propheta: Audite, celi, et auribus percipe, terra, quoniam Dominus locutus est.\nFilios enutriui et exaltaui, ipsi autem spreuerunt me.\nDereliquerunt Dominum, blasphemauerunt sanctum Israel, abalienati sunt retrorsum.\nIdeo terra uestra, ait Dominus, deserta, ciuitates uestre succense igni, regionem uestram coram uobis\nEt cum multiplicaueritis orationem, non exaudiam, manus enim uestre iniquitate sunt plene.\nHaec dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, conuertimini ad me et salui eritis.\nUe impio in malum, retributio manuum eius fiet ei.\nPopulum meum exactores spoliauerunt.\nRapina pauperis in domo uestra.\nHaec dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, et reliqua.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nPro eo quod eleuate sunt filie Sion, et ambulauerunt extenso collo et nutibus oculorum ibant et\nIn die illa auferet Dominus ornatum calciamentorum et lunulas et torques et monilia et armillas, et\nHaec dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, et reliqua.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nUe qui coniungitis domum ad domum et agrum agro copulatis usque ad terminum loci.\nNumquid habitabitis soli uos in medio terrae?\nIn auribus meis sunt haec, dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, et reliqua.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nUe qui consurgitis mane ad bibendum et estis uiri fortes ad ebrietatem sectandam et potandum\nCithara et lira et timpanum in conuiuiis uestris, et opus Domini non respicitis.\nIdeo captiuus ductus est populus meus, quia non habuit scientiam.\nHec dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, et reliqua.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nUe qui sapientes estis in oculis uestris et coram uobismet ipsis prudentes.\nQui iustificatis impium pro muneribus et iustitiam iusti auferetis ab eo.\nHaec dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, et reliqua.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nUe qui dicitis bonum malum et malum bonum, ponentes amarum dulce et dulce in amarum,\nHaec dicit Dominus Deus.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nAudite audientes et nolite intelligere, et uidete uisionem et nolite cognoscere.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nExcece cor populi huius et aures eius adgraua et oculos eius claude, ne forte uideat oculis et\nEt dixit: Usque quo, Domine?\nEt dixit: Donec desolentur ciuitates absque habitatore et terra relinquatur deserta.\nHaec dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, et reliqua.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nUe qui condunt leges iniquas et scribentes iniustitiam scripserunt, ut opprimerent in iudicio\nHaec dicit Dominus, Deus exercituum, et reliqua.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nUe qui descendunt in Egiptum ad auxilium, in equis sperantes et habentes fiduciam super\nHec dicit Dominus, Deus excertuum.\nITEM ISAIAS DICIT\nLauamini, mundi estote, auferte malum cogitationum uestrarum ab oculis meis.\nQuiescite agere peruerse; discite benefacere.\nQuerite iudicium, subuenite obpresso, iudicate pupillo, defendite uiduam.\nUenite et arguite me, dicit Dominus, et reliqua.\nINCIPIUNT UERBA HIEREMIAE PROPHETAE\nAudite uerbum Domini domus Iacob et omnes cognationes domus Israel.\nHaec dicit Dominus: Quid inuenerunt patres uestri in me iniquitatis, quia elongauerunt a me et\nHaec dicit Dominus: Arguat te malitia tua, et auersio tua increpet te.\nEt uide quia malum et amarum est reliquisse Dominum Deum tuum, et non esse timorem eius apud te.\nITEM HIEREMIAS PROPHETA DICIT\nConuertimini, fillii reuertentes, dicit Dominus.\nState super uias et uidete et interrogate de semitis antiquis, que sit uia bona, et ambulate in ea, et\nITEM HIEREMIAS DICIT\nAudite uerbum Domini.\nHec dicit Dominus: Bonas facite uias uestras et studia uestra, et habitabo uobiscum, et reliqua.\nQuoniam si bene direxeritis uias uestras et studia uestra, si feceritis iudicium inter uirum et proximum\nDE UISIONE ISAIE PROPHETAE\nFela is on bocum \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e m\u00e6g to bysnan, gyme se \u00f0e wille, him sylfum to \u00f0earfe.\nAn w\u00e6s on geardagum Gode wel gecweme, Isaias se witega \u00fee Iudea folce fela fores\u00e6de, swa swa hit\nIsaias se witega geseah on gesyh\u00f0e, swa him God u\u00f0e, hu \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeode for heora synnum scolde\nOngan \u00fea singan & \u00f0us secgan: Audite, celi, et auribus percipe, terra, quoniam Dominus locutus est.\nGehyra\u00f0 nu, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, heofonwaru & eor\u00f0waru, hw\u00e6t God sylfa s\u00e6de swytellicre segene.\nBearn ic afedde, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, & up hy ar\u00e6rde, ac hi me forletan & swy\u00f0e ofersawan.\nHy hyrwdan mid wordan \u00fe\u00e6t hy sceoldan herigean, & forletan on d\u00e6dan \u00fe\u00e6t hy scoldan healdan, &\n& for\u00f0am sceal geweor\u00f0an, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, to so\u00f0e ic eow secge, eower eard weste & eac eowre burga mid\n\u00c6l\u00f0eodige men eow sculon hergian, & \u00f0onne ge gebidda\u00fe & to me clypia\u00f0, nelle ic eow gehyran,\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode.\nBE REAFLACUM\nVe impio in malum, et reliqua.\nWa manfullan, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, for his misd\u00e6dan: edlean his weorca eal he sceal habban.\nMin folc is beryped, he cw\u00e6\u00f0 eac, \u00feurh gytsiende reaferas; & wr\u00e6ccena reaflac is on heora hamum, &\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00f0eode.\nBE IDELUM RENCUM.\nPro eo quod eleuate sunt filie Sion, et reliqua.\nFor ofermettan, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, & idelan rencan eowra leoda \u00fee spilia\u00f0 & plega\u00f0 & r\u00e6des ne heda\u00f0, God\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode.\nBE GITSUNGE.\nVe qui coniungitis domum ad domum, et reliqua.\nWa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee lecga\u00f0 tog\u00e6dere hamas & \u00e6hta on unriht begytene on \u00e6ghwilce healfe.\nWene ge \u00fe\u00e6t ge sylfe wealdan & wunian swa lange swa ge willan on \u00f0am \u00fee we nu syn?\nAc so\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, ge hit al\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00feonne ge l\u00e6st wena\u00f0.\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode.\nBE OFERFYLLE.\nVe qui consurgitis mane ad bibendum, et reliqua.\nWa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee lufia\u00f0 untidfylla & \u00e6r on morgen oferdrenc dreoga\u00f0 & beotlice l\u00e6ta\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ge\nHearpe & pipe & mistlic gliggamen drema\u00f0 eow on beorsele; & ge Godes cr\u00e6fta nan \u00f0ing ne gyma\u00f0.\nAnd \u00f0y is folces forfaren ealles to wide mare \u00feonne scolde o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feearf w\u00e6re, & for\u00f0am hit wear\u00f0 swa\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsingodre \u00feeode.\nBE SWICDOME.\nVe qui sapientes estis coram oculis uestris, et reliqua.\nWa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee talia\u00f0 eow sylfe to \u00f0eodwitan & witan \u00fe\u00e6t ge syndan \u00e6bere mannswican.\nGe fylsta\u00f0 on unriht oftost wi\u00f0 sceatte & nella\u00f0 to rihte, butan man gebicge.\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode.\nBE UNRIHTWISNESSE.\nVe qui dicitis bonum malum et malum, et reliqua.\nWa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee talia\u00f0 ungod to gode & god \u00feing to yfele, biter \u00f0ing to swete & swete bel\u00e6\u00fea\u00f0,\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsingodre \u00feeode.\nBE ANDGYTLESTE.\nAudite audientes et nolite intellegere, et reliqua.\nHlysta\u00f0 nu georne, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, & nyta\u00f0 na \u00f0e mare; locia\u00f0 brade & nan \u00feing gecnawa\u00f0 mid \u00e6nigean\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsingodre \u00feeode.\nBe heardheortnesse.\nExceca cor populi huius, et reliqua. ablend \u00feisse \u00feeode, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, andgyt mid ealle nu for heora\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode.\nBE UNLAGUM.\nVe qui condunt leges iniquas, et reliqua.\nWa \u00feam, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee r\u00e6re\u00f0 unriht to rihte & undom deme\u00f0 earmum to hyn\u00f0e & wudewan &\nGyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode.\nBE OFERTRUWAN.\nVe qui descendunt in Egiptum, in equis sperantes, et reliqua.\nWa \u00feam, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee ofertruwa\u00f0 m\u00e6gne & m\u00e6nege & on God ne behiht swa swa he scolde, ne his\n\u00d0as \u00f0ing gewitegode Isaias propheta be Iudean & fela hertoeacan, & eal hit aeode swa swa he s\u00e6de.\nAnd eac hit m\u00e6g to bysne \u00e6ghwylcere \u00feeode, gyme se \u00f0e wille, his agenre \u00f0earfe.\nAnd ongean \u00feas \u00f0ing \u00fee beforan standa\u00f0 he l\u00e6rde \u00fea \u00feeode godcundre lare, \u00fe\u00e6t hy scoldan bugan\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 Godes wordum eac to us eallum.\nHec dicit Dominus: Lauamini, mundi estote, auferte malum cogitationum uestrarum ab oculis meis, et\n\u00c6lmihtig God so\u00f0lice \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: A\u00f0wea\u00f0 eow, ic l\u00e6re, & cl\u00e6nsia\u00f0 eow georne & afyrsia\u00f0 of minre\nGeswica\u00f0 eowra misd\u00e6da & gewunia\u00f0 to godan d\u00e6dan.\nSpyria\u00f0 \u00e6fter rihtan lagan & rihtwisan doman.\nHelpa\u00f0 earmum & h\u00e6fenleasum.\nBeorga\u00f0 steopcildum & weria\u00f0 wudewan, & bidda\u00f0 me sy\u00f0\u00f0an, cw\u00e6\u00f0 ure Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee ge willan,\nGod us gehealde amen.\nVERBA HIEREMIAE PROPHETAE.\nHieremias se witega mynegode to \u00feearfe Godes folc georne.\n& hit \u00f0us l\u00e6rde: Audite uerbum Domini domus Iacob, et reliqua.\nGehyra\u00f0, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Godes word nu \u00f0a, Iacobes hired & eal Israhela cyn.\nGod acsa\u00f0 eow \u00feises nu & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0 to eow eallum: Hw\u00e6t onfundon eowre yldran \u00feurh \u00e6nig \u00f0ing on\n\u00d0y ic \u00f0e secge, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0in agen \u00fewyrnes \u00fee sceal ge\u00feregean, & \u00f0in frambige \u00fee sceal gederian.\nAc beseoh mid gerade & gecnawa\u00f0 swy\u00f0e georne hu biter \u00fee sceal weor\u00f0an, butan \u00feu gecyrre, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 sona \u00fe\u00e6r\u00e6fter froferlicum wordum \u00feus to eallum: Conuertimini, filii reuertentes, dicit\nEala, leofan cild, cw\u00e6\u00f0 ure Drihten, gecyrra\u00f0, ic l\u00e6re, & wenda\u00f0 hider to me, weor\u00f0a\u00fe on rihtwege &\n\u00deonne wyr\u00f0e ge geborgenne gyt, gif ge willa\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ge ne forweor\u00f0a\u00f0.\n\u00d0us Hieremias l\u00e6rde \u00fea \u00f0eode, & oft & gelome he myngode hy georne.\nHe \u00e6t sumum s\u00e6le stod \u00e6t \u00f0am tempelgeate & openlice s\u00e6de & \u00f0us feng on sp\u00e6ce: Audite uerbum\nHec dicit Dominus: Bonas facite uias uestras et studia uestra, et habitabo uobiscum, et reliqua.\nGehyra\u00f0, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Godes word nu \u00f0a & do\u00f0 swa ic l\u00e6re, godia\u00f0 georne eowre agene wegas & ealle\nLufia\u00f0 rihtwisnesse & unriht ascunia\u00f0.\nAnd gyf ge \u00feonne swa do\u00f0 & rihtlice dema\u00f0 & on unriht ne tregia\u00f0 ne earme ne tyrewia\u00f0 ne unscyldig\n\u00d0us ure Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 be us eallum.\nHe ure helpe & us geunne \u00fe\u00e6t we magan & motan his willan aredian, amen.",
